  {
    "name": "Dedupe By Id drops a replayed id and counts it on Duplicates Suppressed (v2, C56); with it off the replay is delivered",
    "params": {
      "autoConnect": true,
      "url": "https://api.example/stream"
    },
    "steps": [
      "settle",
      "settle",
      {
        "advance": 3
      },
      "settle",
      {
        "set": "dedupeById",
        "value": false
      },
      {
        "signal": "connect"
      },
      "settle",
      "settle",
      {
        "advance": 3
      },
      "settle"
    ],
    "world": {
      "network": [
        {
          "answer": {
            "status": 200,
            "chunks": [
              {
                "at": 1,
                "text": "id: 1\ndata: first\n\n"
              },
              {
                "at": 2,
                "text": "id: 1\ndata: again\n\n"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "because": "conn :854-864; the count is not sent until an error (sse :714-719); v2 (P109 ISL-030, P107-C56 ruled \"Send them when they change\"): the count is sent as it moves (onDuplicate) — v1 counted silently"
  },
