  {
    "name": "A URL change while a Connect waits, Auto Connect off: torn down, nothing reconnects, and it says idle (v3, C58); the pending Connect Unchanged",
    "params": {
      "url": "https://api.example/stream"
    },
    "steps": [
      "settle",
      {
        "signal": "connect"
      },
      {
        "set": "url",
        "value": "https://api.example/other"
      },
      "settle",
      {
        "advance": 5
      },
      "settle"
    ],
    "world": {
      "network": [
        {
          "answer": {
            "status": 200,
            "chunks": []
          },
          "after": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    "because": "sse :565-580 — only the URL decides; the rebuild mints no token; Auto Connect is off so nothing reconnects; v3 (P109 ISL-030, P107-C58 ruled \"Say idle, as WebSocket does\"): the three state outputs sent with idle. Its v1/v2 name said \"reconnects to the new one\", which it never did"
  },
